OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after two children and man
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree pedestrians, including two
OL,7,Fchildren, have been taken to hospital
OL,8,Fafter a collision in an East Sussex
OL,9,Fvillage.
OL,11,FPolice said the man and the two
OL,12,Fchildren were taken to hospital with
OL,13,Finjuries after the crash at about 08:30
OL,14,FGMT on the B2240 at The Stream,
OL,15,FCatsfield.
OL,17,FA 72-year-old man was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,19,Fdangerous driving and remained in
OL,20,Fcustody. He was also arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of driving while unfit
OL,22,Fthrough drink or drugs, police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
